---
[projlang/surface] Bind reviewed grammar (notstarted) @dispatch(mechanical)
Files: Projection-language implementation files named at dispatch.
Do: Map every reviewed projection-language production to an internal form and its settled stage: select, invert, decorate, or check. Reject any form that needs unruled semantics.
Accept: Every reviewed production maps to exactly one settled stage; failures identify the source location; no task-local syntax or semantic rule is introduced.
@guidance text/markdown ./proposals/projection-language.md
@guidance text/markdown ./spec/grimoire.md
---
[projlang/structural] Evaluate structural stages (notstarted) @dispatch(mechanical)
Files: Structural projection evaluator files introduced by this task.
Do: Evaluate select-generated definitions and references, then apply invert to the selected group. Keep finalization values unavailable during structural evaluation.
Accept: Fixtures cover generated and referenced definitions as ordinary definitions, plus inversion of selected connections; no finalization value changes structural output.
-> projlang/surface
@guidance text/markdown ./proposals/projection-language.md
@guidance text/markdown ./spec/grimoire.md
---
[projlang/fold] Fold structural results (notstarted) @dispatch(mechanical)
Files: Structural fold implementation files introduced by this task.
Do: Join structural references by address and chain structural results by composition. Surface a competing definition at one address as an error.
Accept: Fixtures prove shared references join, chained results compose, and competing definitions fail visibly.
-> projlang/structural
@guidance text/markdown ./proposals/projection-language.md
@guidance text/markdown ./spec/grimoire.md
---
[projlang/finalize] Apply global finalization (notstarted) @dispatch(mechanical)
Files: Projection finalization implementation files introduced by this task.
Do: Apply decorate once to the folded structural result, attaching schema-governed values without feeding them back into structural evaluation.
Accept: Finalization runs after structural folding; finalized values remain attached to folded elements; structural evaluation has no finalization-value input.
-> projlang/fold
@guidance text/markdown ./proposals/projection-language.md
@guidance text/markdown ./spec/grimoire.md
---
[projlang/checks] Evaluate decoration checks (notstarted) @dispatch(mechanical)
Files: Projection check implementation files introduced by this task.
Do: Evaluate expected empty or nonempty cardinality only over finalized decoration values. Return the check result without altering finalized structure or values.
Accept: Fixtures cover expected-empty and expected-nonempty outcomes; checks cannot observe structural data except through finalized decorations; finalized data is unchanged afterward.
-> projlang/finalize
@guidance text/markdown ./proposals/projection-language.md
@guidance text/markdown ./spec/grimoire.md
---
[projlang/conformance] Exercise semantic conformance (notstarted) @dispatch(mechanical)
Files: Projection-language conformance fixtures introduced by this task.
Do: Build fixtures in the reviewed grammar that exercise every implemented stage and the required error paths. Keep runtime execution out of the fixtures.
Accept: Fixtures cover stage order, generated and referenced definitions, invert, address folding, competing-definition failure, finalization non-feedback, and decoration-only checks.
-> projlang/checks
@guidance text/markdown ./proposals/projection-language.md
@guidance text/markdown ./spec/grimoire.md
