[projlang/review] Review projection implementation (notstarted)
Files: Projection-language implementation and conformance fixtures.
Do: Review implementation and fixtures against the reviewed grammar, core specification, and projection-language design artifact. Escalate any behavior not settled by those artifacts.
Accept: Every implemented behavior maps to a settled semantic rule; deferred selector and symbolic-value syntax remains owned by grammar and schemas; no runtime behavior is introduced.
-> projlang/conformance
